id: pm-graph-l9df
title: Fix runGraph projected result narrowing and bump pm-cli to 2026.8.3
description: "pm-cli 2026.8.3 changed the SDK runGraph return type from GraphResult to ProjectedGraphResult (GraphResult plus an output projection declaration). The generic wrapper runPmGraph in src/index.ts casts that to an unresolved type parameter T, which fails typecheck with TS2352. Fix: remove the type parameter, return the projected result, and narrow on the subcommand discriminant at the single impact call site with a CommandError guard. Also bump the pm-cli pin to 2026.8.3 in devDependencies and peerDependencies with a committed lockfile refresh. Supersedes dependabot PR 51."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
